  "details": "It used to be that if I open up the radial menu and turn on or toggle anything animations or states like normal and then put it away, it remembers where I left off when I re-open it, which I liked.\nI noticed after the latest update with the new menu that after leaving the Radial Menu, opening up the Quick Menu, and then re-opening the Radial Menu, it forgets where I was. This was not present during the beta (as far as I know).\n\nI don't know if I just use the quick menu more than I thought without realizing it, but it almost seems to do it by itself sometimes.",
